ncy and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1dipxCrjN_cQ7kNvwHZp9bf&_nc_oc=AdqxpEGGLEzlVeoTPt9hjOIUWnWav1TRQ4KTm8j1KuvIi6VRnQhmYm5Kh0BA9I8Sllk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCyioe0rP9cxFBVZdTjX6YJBKnMcB7fKUelo5hoKwf10A&oe=6A6A00B9"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VwzBjVhkQmoQ7kNvwGqMJ2s&_nc_oc=AdpdX9FhO7hfnBW9a3df9VekoQ6qaZmJe9JkYhWwNf5o4eYdXQeidwFgdGhI93DedfA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB4-RzCFHpA6ytFHeV6oWo80qZJMyNN6Pn4U-wBVDhD1g&oe=6A69EF0F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WJ31m3W2_2QQ7kNvwHJg7bv&_nc_oc=Adq2y_an8O2H7yedNcpPmZq3FWORJGKpplaQ0VnaQPJdzvB4D54b2q2RmxCwimyhoGc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD5Z016dI26wIC0otI4g73ZC7kiotPv4i9l50E_3DO16Q&oe=6A69FCEE"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squar